ad of getting stuck on an older cached copy.\n- ⚡ **Faster browsing of large collections.** Snapshot and output API requests avoid repeatedly loading large crawl inputs and related records.\n- 📦 **Updated capture tools.** Includes the latest tested downloader and plugin packages, including upstream SingleFile improvements.\n\nSee [v0.9.76](https://github.com/ArchiveBox/ArchiveBox/releases/tag/v0.9.76) for AI-powered social imports, chat bots, smoother replay, and screenshots of the new interfaces.\n"}